# ponytail: every pattern is **-prefixed on purpose. Unlike .gitignore,
# .dockerignore matches only at the context root — bare "node_modules/" leaves
# nested copies in the build context, and bare ".env*" leaks nested secrets.

# agent tooling — never needed in an image, and .claude/ can hold local settings
**/.claude/
**/.agents/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/skills-lock.json

# secrets
**/.env*
**/.clerk/
**/*.pem

# dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# vcs and editor
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store

# docs and local logs
**/README.md
**/documents/
**/*-debug.log*
